<Layout title="About — Westport, Unfiltered">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding: 40px 0; max-width: 640px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:26px; margin-bottom:16px;">About</h1>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--color-ink-soft); margin-bottom:24px;">
      Placeholder about copy — lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.
    </p>

    <h2 id="ratings" style="font-size:18px; margin-bottom:10px;">How we rate</h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
      The numbers here aren't averages — they're one person's honest take. An 8 means I'd go back without thinking twice.
      A 6 means it's fine, but I wouldn't rearrange my week for it. I'm weighing food, service, and vibe together,
      not scoring them separately — the same way you'd actually decide where to eat.
    </p>
